    5511   00:5B47  18 F5                   jr  TCPIP_TCP_RCV_ST2A
    5512   00:5B49                      TCPIP_TCP_RCV_ST2A.1:
    5513   00:5B49                          ; nz, high byte count of bytes to receive
    5514   00:5B49                          RECEIVE_DATA
    5514   00:5B49  DB 06             >     in a,(IN_DATA_PORT)
