    6278   00:5EAD                      
    6279   00:5EAD                      ;--- Obtain slot work area (8 bytes) on SLTWRK
    6280   00:5EAD                      ;    Input:  A  = Slot number
    6281   00:5EAD                      ;    Output: HL = Work area address
    6282   00:5EAD                      ;    Modifies: AF, BC
    6283   00:5EAD                      
    6284   00:5EAD                      GETWRK:
